		{
			dependencies: ["1FA9577AA6C0D787"]
			description: [
				"AE2's autocrafting has one long-standing blind spot: a pattern assumes one machine takes a set of inputs and hands back one output."
				""
				"Plenty of machines in this pack don't work that way - Mekanism's multi-input chains, Immersive Engineering's multiblocks, anything that returns several products at once."
				""
				"&ePackagedAuto&r fixes exactly that. Encode a recipe on the &eEncoder&r, and the &ePackager&r and &eUnpackager&r bundle the inputs, deliver them together, and return every output to the network."
			]
			icon: "packagedauto:packager"
			id: "7E30200000000003"
			rewards: [
